      "explanation": "'Had met' shows an action completed before another past action/time (the visit) \u2014 that's the marker of the past perfect tense.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Past perfect is a flashback within a past story \u2014 the meeting happened even earlier than the 'while visiting' scene.",
