      "question": "Method of spiritual practice called Integral Yoga was developed by?",
      "options": [
        "Sri Aurobindo",
        "M.K.Gandhi",
        "G.K.Gokhale",
        "Amal Kiran"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "Sri Aurobindo developed 'Integral Yoga', a spiritual practice aiming to unite the whole being with the Divine through everyday life and action, not just meditation.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Integral Yoga is like a workout plan for your whole life, not just your muscles \u2014 body, mind, and soul all training together, as Sri Aurobindo designed it.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Gandhi is a tempting guess given his own spiritual practices, but 'Integral Yoga' is specifically Aurobindo's coined system, developed at his Pondicherry ashram.",
