      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "B.R. Ambedkar is correctly linked with the fight against untouchability, having led the movement for Dalit rights throughout his life.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Pair Ambedkar with untouchability the way you'd pair a doctor with the disease they spent their whole career curing.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f 'Nehru \u2013 New Lamps for Old' sounds plausible, but that work was written by Sri Aurobindo, not Nehru \u2014 a classic mismatched-pair trap.",
      "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
