      "topic": "gs2_economy",
      "topicLabel": "RBI establishment",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "RBI was established in the year",
      "options": [
        "1st January 1935",
        "1st March 1935",
        "1st April 1935",
        "none of these"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "The Reserve Bank of India commenced operations on 1st April 1935, under the RBI Act of 1934.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 RBI's official 'birthday' is 1st April 1935 \u2014 easy to remember since it's also the start of the Indian financial year.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f 1st January 1935 is a tempting 'new year' guess, but RBI's actual commencement date is 1st April, matching the financial year start, not the calendar year.",
      "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
      "year": 2016,
