      "subject": "english",
      "topic": "eng_vocab",
      "topicLabel": "Vocabulary - inevitable (meaning check)",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Choose the word opposite in meaning to the word in bold: It was inevitable that they should part.",
