      "answerIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "'Inevitable' means something that cannot be avoided, matching the option 'unavoidable' most closely among the choices given.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Like the sunset every evening - no matter what you do, it's coming; that's the sense of 'inevitable'.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f 'Impossible' sounds related but describes something that can't happen at all, the opposite of something that's certain to happen.",
