      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Read the following statements 1. Lakshadweep Islands are generally coral origin 2. Andaman & Nicobar group of Islands are coral origin 3. Lakshadweep Islands are coral origin and developed around volcanic peak Choose the correct option",
