      "subject": "gk",
      "topic": "gs3_mizoram",
      "topicLabel": "Greatest Mizoram revival wave",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "question": "Which was considered the \u201cgreatest and most powerful\u201d revival in Mizoram?",
      "options": [
        "The First Wave",
        "The Second Wave",
        "The Third Wave",
        "The Fourth Wave"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "The Second Wave of revival (around 1913) is often described as the greatest and most powerful of Mizoram's Christian revivals, marked by widespread fervour.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 If the First Wave was a ripple, the Second Wave was the tsunami everyone still talks about - the one that changed the most lives.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f It's tempting to assume 'later must mean bigger', so people sometimes guess the Third or Fourth Wave instead.",
