      "explanation": "The Young Mizo Association (YMA), founded in 1935, is widely regarded as the first major organisation formed by the Mizos themselves.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 YMA became the 'mother organisation' of Mizo civil society - like the first club in town that every later group modelled itself after.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Lushai Students' Association also existed early on, so it's easy to mix up which one truly counts as 'the first'.",
