      "topicLabel": "Mizo National Front history",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Which of the following statements is / are correct about the MNF party? 1. The party chose \u2018Self-determination\u2019 as its aim. 2. The party declared independence for Mizoram against Indian Union on 5th March 1966. 3. It was declared an unlawful association under the Defense of India Rule on 6th March 1966.",
