      "id": "mpsc-tax-0006",
      "subject": "history",
      "topic": "gs1_history",
      "topicLabel": "Tilak's Swaraj slogan",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Who gave the famous slogan, \u2018Swaraj is my birth right and I shall have it\u2019?",
