      "explanation": "Lord Curzon, the Viceroy, ordered the partition of Bengal in 1905, officially citing administrative convenience but actually aiming to weaken the nationalist movement by dividing Hindus and Muslims.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Think of a parent splitting up two squabbling siblings' shared room to reduce their combined strength \u2014 Curzon split Bengal to break the unity of Bengali nationalists.",
