      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "Raja Ram Mohan Roy founded the Brahmo Samaj in 1828 in Calcutta to reform Hindu society and promote monotheism, rejecting idol worship.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Picture someone starting a stripped-down prayer group that drops all the extra rituals and focuses only on the core belief in one God \u2014 that's what Roy did in 1828.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f 1875 is tempting because that's actually when the Arya Samaj was founded by Dayanand Saraswati, a similar-sounding but different reform organization.",
