      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "'Teem with' means to be full of something, so 'with' pairs with 'teeming' to show abundance.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 A head 'teeming with ideas' is like a jar teeming with ants, packed full and buzzing.",
      "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
