      "topic": "eng_vocab",
      "topicLabel": "Antonyms",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "What is the antonym of 'consensus' in the context of group decisions?",
      "options": [
        "Approval",
        "Disagreement",
        "Accord",
        "Harmony"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "'Consensus' means general agreement, so its opposite is 'Disagreement'.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Consensus is everyone nodding 'yes' together; disagreement is the room splitting into arguing camps.",
