      "topicLabel": "Deep Ocean Mission & polymetallic nodules",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "India\u2019s Deep Ocean Mission involves the development of technologies for mining Polymetallic Nodules from the seabed. These nodules are of significant economic interest primarily due to their high concentration of:",
