      "topicLabel": "MPI dimensions",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "Multi-dimensional Poverty Index (MPI) includes - 1. Health 2. Education 3. Living standard Codes :",
      "options": [
        "Only 1",
        "2 and 3",
        "land2",
        "1,2and3"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 3,
      "explanation": "The Multidimensional Poverty Index (MPI) is built on three equally weighted dimensions: health, education, and standard of living.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 MPI is a three-legged stool of poverty measurement \u2014 health, education and living standard; remove any one leg and it doesn't stand as 'multidimensional' anymore.",
      "source": "MPSC State Tax Officer / Group B Gazetted",
      "year": 2024,
      "paperId": "mpsc-group-b-combined-(state-tax-officer-/-cooperative-audit-officer)-2024-gs-ii"
