      "explanation": "The Iron and Steel industry is the largest mineral-based industry in India, forming the backbone of heavy manufacturing.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Iron and steel is the 'big machine' industry \u2014 almost every other factory (cars, ships, bridges) depends on steel, making it the giant among mineral-based industries.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Cement is also mineral-based and huge in volume, but in terms of overall industrial scale/importance, Iron and Steel is considered the largest.",
